---

<main class="ics-case" aria-label="Integrated Channels Suite case study">
  <section class="ics-section ics-overview" id="overview" aria-labelledby="ics-overview-title">
    <div class="ics-page ics-overview-page">
      <div class="ics-overview-copy">
        <p class="ics-kicker">DIGITAL BANKING PLATFORM</p>
        <h1 id="ics-overview-title">Integrated<br />Channels Suite</h1>
        <h2>A configurable digital platform<br />for banks and NBFCs.</h2>
        <i class="ics-gradient-rule" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <p class="ics-overview-lede">Integrated Channels Suite is a multi-application banking platform that brings together lending, payments, customer servicing, compliance and other core banking operations. It includes 12 specialized applications that can be deployed individually or as a unified suite, configured to meet each institution’s regulatory and business requirements.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="ics-overview-visual" aria-label="Banking platform workspace for desktop and mobile">
        <div class="ics-entity-row">
          <div><span class="ics-icon tone-blue">⌂</span><b>Banks</b><small>Public | Private | Cooperative</small></div>
          <div><span class="ics-icon tone-violet">▥</span><b>NBFCs</b><small>Lending | Housing | Microfinance</small></div>
          <div><span class="ics-icon tone-green">⬡</span><b>Compliance Ready</b><small>RBI, FIU, CKYC, AML, GST and audit requirements</small></div>
        </div>
        <div class="ics-workspace-scene">
          <article class="ics-callout ics-callout-workflow"><span class="ics-icon tone-blue">⚙</span><b>Configurable<br />Workflows</b><small>Adapt to regulatory and institution-specific requirements.</small></article>
          <article class="ics-callout ics-callout-modular"><span class="ics-icon tone-violet">▱</span><b>Modular<br />Deployment</b><small>Deploy individual applications or as a unified suite.</small></article>
          <div class="ics-laptop">
            <div class="ics-laptop-screen">
              <aside><b>◈</b><strong>Integrated<br />Channels</strong><span>⌂ Home</span><span>▦ Applications</span><span>♧ Customers</span><span>▤ Transactions</span><span>⬡ Compliance</span><span>▮ Reports</span></aside>
              <div class="ics-dashboard">
                <div class="ics-searchbar">⌕ <span>Search customer, account or transaction...</span><b>●　?　MP</b></div>
                <h3>Banking Overview</h3>
                <div class="ics-quick-stats"><span>♧<b>Customers</b></span><span>▰<b>Accounts</b></span><span>▥<b>Loans</b></span><span>↗<b>Payments</b></span></div>
                <div class="ics-dashboard-panels"><article><b>Application Activity</b><div class="ics-bars"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></article><article><b>Operational Status</b><div class="ics-donut"></div><small>● Applications Online<br />● Under Maintenance<br />● Scheduled</small></article></div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="ics-laptop-base"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="ics-phone"><div class="ics-phone-top">◈ Integrated Channels　☰</div><b>Quick Actions</b><div class="ics-phone-actions"><span>♧<small>Customer</small></span><span>▰<small>Loan</small></span><span>↗<small>Payment</small></span><span>⬡<small>Compliance</small></span><span>▤<small>Reports</small></span><span>···<small>More</small></span></div><b>Recent Activities</b><p>🔵 Loan Application<br /><small>In Progress</small></p><p>🟢 Payment Processed<br /><small>Successful</small></p><p>◉ CKYC Validation<br /><small>Completed</small></p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="ics-overview-pillars">
        {overviewPillars.map(([icon, title, text, tone]) => <article class={`tone-${tone}`}><span class="ics-icon">{icon}</span><div><h3>{title}</h3><p>{text}</p></div></article>)}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="ics-section ics-ecosystem" id="ecosystem" aria-labelledby="ics-ecosystem-title">
    <div class="ics-page ics-ecosystem-page">
      <aside class="ics-dark-panel ics-ecosystem-story">
        <p class="ics-kicker">DIGITAL BANKING ECOSYSTEM</p>
        <h2 id="ics-ecosystem-title">A connected product ecosystem for <em>banks</em> and <em>NBFCs.</em></h2>
        <i class="ics-gradient-rule" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <p>Brings together 12 configurable banking applications on a common platform with shared controls, reporting, and institution-specific workflows.</p>
        <article><span class="ics-icon tone-blue">▱</span><div><b>12 specialised applications</b><small>Core banking, compliance, operations and customer functions.</small></div></article>
        <article><span class="ics-icon tone-green">⚙</span><div><b>Common platform controls</b><small>Unified user management, security, audit, reporting and monitoring.</small></div></article>
        <article><span class="ics-icon tone-violet">☷</span><div><b>Configurable institution workflows</b><small>Tailored to bank or NBFC business processes and regulatory needs.</small></div></article>
      </aside>
      <div class="ics-ecosystem-board" aria-label="The twelve connected Integrated Channels Suite applications">
        <svg class="ics-ecosystem-connectors" viewBox="0 0 1000 700" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><g fill="none" stroke-width="5"><path d="M500 350 C420 230 260 130 145 85" stroke="#8b36ed"/><path d="M500 350 C500 190 500 130 500 85" stroke="#087ff0"/><path d="M500 350 C580 230 740 130 855 85" stroke="#00a986"/><path d="M500 350 C700 270 800 210 855 210" stroke="#e72c82"/><path d="M500 350 C720 350 790 350 855 350" stroke="#087ff0"/><path d="M500 350 C700 440 800 490 855 490" stroke="#8139ed"/><path d="M500 350 C580 500 740 580 855 615" stroke="#ff9400"/><path d="M500 350 C500 520 500 580 500 615" stroke="#ed2580"/><path d="M500 350 C420 500 260 580 145 615" stroke="#087ff0"/><path d="M500 350 C300 440 200 490 145 490" stroke="#00a986"/><path d="M500 350 C280 350 210 350 145 350" stroke="#ff9400"/><path d="M500 350 C300 270 200 210 145 210" stroke="#8139ed"/></g></svg>
        {apps.map((app, index) => <button class:list={['ics-eco-node', `ics-node-${index + 1}`]} type="button" data-open={app.id} style={`--app-tone:${app.color}`} aria-label={`Open ${displayName[app.id] ?? app.name} product workspace`}><span class="ics-icon">{appGlyph[app.id]}</span><span class="ics-eco-text"><small>{String(index + 1).padStart(2, '0')}</small><b>{displayName[app.id] ?? app.name}</b><em>{displayCategory[app.id] ?? app.category}</em></span></button>)}
        <div class="ics-ecosystem-hub"><span>⌂</span><b>Integrated<br />Channels Suite</b><small>12 applications · shared platform · configurable workflows</small></div>
        <p class="ics-ecosystem-note">Applications could be accessed individually from the suite to open their dedicated workflows and product details.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="ics-section ics-challenge" id="challenge" aria-labelledby="ics-challenge-title">
    <div class="ics-page ics-challenge-page">
      <div class="ics-challenge-copy">
        <p class="ics-kicker">THE CHALLENGE</p>
        <h2 id="ics-challenge-title">Why a Unified Platform was <em>Needed?</em></h2>
        <p>Banks and NBFCs were operating with multiple standalone systems across lending, payments, compliance and operations, leading to inefficiencies, higher operational effort and slower time-to-market.</p>
        <p>Evolving regulatory requirements, integration with core banking systems and the need for a configurable, institution-ready solution created a strong need for a unified digital banking platform.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="ics-challenge-cards">
        {challenges.map(([title, text, tone, icon]) => <article class={`ics-challenge-card tone-${tone}`}><span class="ics-icon">{icon}</span><div><h3>{title}</h3><p>{text}</p></div></article>)}
      </div>
      <aside class="ics-impact-panel">
        <div class="ics-bank-visual" aria-label="Banking district illustration">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 500 280" role="img" aria-label="Bank building among city towers"><defs><linearGradient id="bankGlass" x1="0" x2="1" y1="0" y2="1"><stop stop-color="#84c9ff"/><stop offset=".48" stop-color="#116fc6"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#073264"/></linearGradient></defs><path fill="#8fcaf1" d="M0 190 90 110l60 44 87-119 74 89 72-55 117 72v139H0z"/><path fill="#d1e8f8" d="M0 228 80 160l73 39 95-113 64 79 65-41 123 71v91H0z"/><path fill="url(#bankGlass)" d="M206 19h192v245H206z"/><path fill="#063d75" d="M314 19h84v245h-84z"/><g stroke="#bfe6ff" stroke-width="4" opacity=".8"><path d="M230 23v238M258 23v238M286 23v238M314 23v238M342 23v238M370 23v238M208 60h188M208 100h188M208 140h188M208 180h188M208 220h188"/></g><text x="231" y="143" fill="#fff" font-family="Arial,sans-serif" font-size="42" font-weight="800" transform="rotate(-12 231 143)">BANK</text></svg>
        </div>
        <div class="ics-impact-copy"><h3>Business Impact</h3><p>These challenges created operational, compliance and growth constraints for banks and NBFCs, highlighting the need for a unified, configurable and integration-ready digital banking platform.</p>
          <article><span class="ics-icon tone-blue">◷</span><div><b>Slower Time-to-Market</b><small>New products and regulatory changes took longer to implement.</small></div></article>
          <article><span class="ics-icon tone-green">₹</span><div><b>Higher Operational Costs</b><small>Manual processes and multiple systems increased operational effort and cost.</small></div></article>
          <article><span class="ics-icon tone-violet">▮</span><div><b>Limited Scalability</b><small>Fragmented architecture made it difficult to scale across more institutions and products.</small></div></article>
        </div>
      </aside>
      <div class="ics-challenge-themes"><p class="ics-kicker">KEY CHALLENGE THEMES</p>{challengeThemes.map(([title, text, tone, icon]) => <article class={`tone-${tone}`}><span class="ics-icon">{icon}</span><div><b>{title}</b><small>{text}</small></div></article>)}</div>
    </div>
  </section>

